From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Hertenberger <erde74@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:31:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/25] plan9: rustc for 9front (no mmap: files read, no
 ctrlc), getrandom 0.3.3 port; std's __plan9_exit; llvm-project on its plan9
 branch

rustc_data_structures::memmap reads the file on plan9 (as on wasm: no
mmap); ctrlc is left out (an interrupt is a note that ends the process);
getrandom 0.3.3 from 9front-rust's crates/ ([patch.crates-io]).
std: __plan9_exit for APE's exit and abort (9front's _exit.c, abort.c):
the C's exit ends the whole program. src/llvm-project: the plan9 branch
(bootstrap had reset it to Rust's commit).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
